# Release Safety

- Do not publish GitHub Releases without green validation and human approval.
- Ship qpdf (and licenses) inside the app — users must not install PDF tools separately for production builds.
- Produce checksums for release artifacts.
- Do not enable auto-update without a dedicated reviewed design.
- Never claim SmartScreen warnings are “solved” without code signing.
- CI validates; early pipelines must not auto-publish.
